Artwork and third-party intellectual property

The artwork distributed with DeckKit (the Steam library artwork in
deck-setup/wowforever-art/ and the DeckKit logo in media/) is unofficial
fan-created content, generated with the assistance of artificial intelligence.

The artwork is provided free of charge for personal, noncommercial use; the
Steam library artwork for customizing Steam libraries.

Third-party intellectual property

World of Warcraft(R), Warcraft(R), and associated names, characters, logos,
artwork, and other intellectual property belong to Blizzard Entertainment, Inc.
and their respective rights holders.

DeckKit is an independent community project and is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or sponsored by Blizzard Entertainment or Valve Corporation.

Licensing

The MIT License above (the project's source-code license) does not apply to
these artwork assets.

No license to third-party intellectual property is granted or implied by the
distribution of these files.

No exclusive copyright claim is asserted over purely AI-generated portions of
the artwork. Any independently copyrightable human contributions are reserved
unless separately licensed.

These assets are provided for personal, noncommercial use, subject to
applicable third-party rights. If you are a rights holder and want something
removed, open an issue and it will be investigated.

